---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for lattix.co and the Lattix platform.">
  <section class="bg-ink px-5 py-20 text-cream sm:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-5xl tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-mist">Last updated August 29, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="prose-lattix bg-paper px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <p>
        This policy describes how Lattix collects, uses, and shares information on lattix.co and, for
        customers, on the Lattix platform. It is a working draft we will refine with counsel. It is
        not legal advice.
      </p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">The marketing site</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          When you visit lattix.co we collect standard server logs (IP address, user agent, pages
          requested) to operate and secure the site. If you submit the contact form, we receive the
          name, email, organization, role, and message you provide, and we use that information to
          respond. We do not sell website data.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">The platform</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Lattix processes protected health information on behalf of covered entities and business
          associates under a Business Associate Agreement. PHI is used only for the permitted
          purposes of use configured for your tenant — treatment, payment, and operations as
          applicable. We do not use PHI for advertising.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The marketing site does not currently set advertising cookies. Essential cookies or local
          storage may be used for load balancing and security. Analytics, if added later, will be
          disclosed here.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Retention and rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Contact inquiries are retained as long as needed to respond and for a reasonable business
          record. Platform retention follows the BAA and applicable law. To access, correct, or
          delete website information we hold about you, email
          <a href="mailto:privacy@lattix.co">privacy@lattix.co</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Privacy inquiries: <a href="mailto:privacy@lattix.co">privacy@lattix.co</a>. Security:
          <a href="mailto:security@lattix.co">security@lattix.co</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
